<tr>
  <td>
    <p>Hi,</p>
    {% if outcome == 'approved' %}
    <p>Good news - your Synkra {{ programme_name }} application has been approved. {{ programme_name }} pricing is now available from Settings → Billing.</p>
    {% elsif outcome == 'needs_info' %}
    <p>We need a little more information to finish reviewing your Synkra {{ programme_name }} application.</p>
    <p><strong>{{ note }}</strong></p>
    <p>Add it from Settings → Billing and we'll pick your application up again.</p>
    {% else %}
    <p>Thanks for applying for Synkra {{ programme_name }} pricing. We weren't able to approve this application.</p>
    <p><strong>{{ note }}</strong></p>
    <p>You're welcome to apply again with updated evidence. You can keep using your current plan in the meantime.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </td>
</tr>
